ealthy in production. After the rollback the error rate dropped to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback, and the verified recovery. It also paged the on-call engineer.\n- **Follow-up:** v2.3.1 is still unhealthy in production, so it should be investigated before anyone redeploys it.", "type": "text"}]}]}